          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Takedowns, </span><span class=\"futura-bold\">the Target way</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Target Xtra brings the smooth, stable performance physicians expect from Target to vessel takedown.&nbsp;</b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Engineered for vessel takedown, its unique coil architecture is designed to anchor, plug and pack efficiently for controlled vessel occlusion.</span></p>\n",
