          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">86%</span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><sup>*</sup></span></span><br>\n average reduction in flow <br>\n with just one coil</span></p>\n",
