          "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 01 2026 11:17:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">With Xtra, less is more</span></h2>\n<p>Designed to do more with less, Target Xtra combines our proven tetrahedral design with extended lengths on a 0.010&quot; platform to help create a dense, stable plug for efficient vessel occlusion. Available in lengths up to 32 cm, Target Xtra is designed to help achieve vessel occlusion with fewer coils.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jul 20 2026 11:03:27 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
